#  DESCRIPTION
#    This is the Bulk-IN Endpoint Message Decode file for SmartCard CCIDs 
#      (ICC Interface Devices). 
#    This file is prepared as per the Specification Revision 1.1.
#    This file is prepared as per the Integrated Circuit(s) Cards Interface
#      Devices Specification for the SmartCard Class.
#
#  REVISION HISTORY
#    03/20/2005
#    01/07/2007   Updated for CCID Rev. 1.1 from 1.0; Updated script
#
